WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:05,010
Miss Chen came in person

2
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:06,530
It seems like I really can’t hold it any longer.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:10,870
I'm here to talk about cooperation. Let me guess.

4
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:14,110
If you don't have enough salt, you won't be able to eat enough fruits.

5
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:16,590
I suggest you guys be willing to lose your skin.

6
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:19,230
Let’s talk about using people’s hands in exchange for materials

7
00:00:19,390 --> 00:00:21,470
We send one person over every day to help you work

8
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:22,710
Come on the same day, return on the same day

9
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:23,950
You are paid on a daily basis

10
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:25,950
Salt is fine, food is fine too

11
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:27,110
It's just a temporary job

12
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:29,470
Yes, I will go on the same day and return on the same day.

13
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:32,030
Settlement once a day without default

14
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,970
This is the bottom line of cooperation

15
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,480
But salary

16
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,600
Depends on the job

17
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:41,000
Well done. There are meat and vegetables. If not well done, come and work for a day.

18
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:42,120
I won't give you a straw

19
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:44,120
Can you set a guarantee?

20
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,760
This way, everyone will have a safe mind.

21
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,360
I'm afraid you haven't woken up yet

22
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,760
Now it's you who come to beg me, not me who begs you.

23
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:53,220
mutual relationship

24
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,740
Do you understand that Party A is the same as Party A?

25
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,480
If you think I'm being too high-minded

26
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,960
Then you can go and cooperate with Jiang Yue, but

27
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:00,320
There is only salt and fire

28
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,520
But I don’t have as many resources

29
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:06,560
Then at least you have to be back before dark, so you can rest assured.

30
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,880
Why do I detain your people for having more mouths?

31
00:01:09,040 --> 00:01:12,610
I still have to support a bed, so that's it. Happy cooperation.
